# scenario: first-run
# Join a suggested federation; the tabs appear.
expect Join a federation
shot join
click Join
expect Fedi Alpha
shot tabs
click Spending
# Refill needs Saving: not offered until it exists.
expect 0 of 0.05 target
expect-not Refill from Saving
shot spending
click Saving
expect Connect a hardware wallet or use this computer
shot saving
click Set up
expect Set up Saving
# This computer comes after the hardware wallet, with what it costs.
expect Ledger Nano S+
expect This computer
expect Keys stay on this computer. A hardware wallet is safer for large amounts.
shot setup-dialog
click Set up
expect Saving is set up
expect Ledger Nano S+
shot saving-ready
click Spending
# Below target, but Saving holds nothing yet: there is nothing to refill from.
expect 0 of 0.05 target
expect-not Refill from Saving
